{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "thalamus_llmd",
    "project": "thalamus"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "Thalamus llm-d"
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "TextVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Rate Interval",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "value": "15m",
          "name": "rate_interval"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "TextVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Rate Multiplier (per-second \u2192 per-hour = 3600)",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "value": "1",
          "name": "rate_multiplier"
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "readme": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "README"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "Markdown",
            "spec": {
              "text": "# Thalamus Debug LLM-d\n\nDiagnostic metrics from the llm-d endpoint picker / router (EPP) \u2014 isolates whether the router, scheduling, or prefix-routing layer is contributing to an SLO breach. Everything here is from EPP's perspective. The model-server view lives in Debug/vLLM.\n\nLatency histograms are split into **p50** and **p99**. Some EPP metrics carry no model label, so the model is derived from the `job` label.\n\n## Variables\n\n- `rate_interval` controls the smoothing window for histogram/counter rates. Shorter windows expose bursts, longer windows smooth sparse traffic.\n- `rate_multiplier` scales counter rates, which Prometheus always returns per second. Use `1` for per-second, `60` for per-minute, or `3600` for per-hour values. Axis labels remain in their default per-second units."
            }
          },
          "queries": []
        }
      },
      "avg_queue_size": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Average Queue Size",
            "description": "Average queued request count across endpoints, per model."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "visual": {
                "areaOpacity": 0.3,
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineStyle": "solid",
                "lineWidth": 1.5,
                "pointRadius": 2
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "format": {
                  "unit": "decimal"
                },
                "min": 0,
                "show": true,
                "label": "count"
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource"
                    },
                    "query": "sum by (name) (llm_d_epp_average_queue_size)",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{name}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "per_endpoint_queue_size": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Per-Endpoint Queue Size",
            "description": "Queue depth per vLLM endpoint."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "visual": {
                "areaOpacity": 0.3,
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineStyle": "solid",
                "lineWidth": 1.5,
                "pointRadius": 2
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "format": {
                  "unit": "decimal"
                },
                "min": 0,
                "show": true,
                "label": "count"
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource"
                    },
                    "query": "sum by (model_server_endpoint) (llm_d_epp_per_endpoint_queue_size)",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{model_server_endpoint}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "scheduler_e2e_p50": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Scheduler E2E p50",
            "description": "Median time EPP takes to pick an endpoint."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "visual": {
                "areaOpacity": 0.1,
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineStyle": "solid",
                "lineWidth": 1.5,
                "pointRadius": 2
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "format": {
                  "unit": "seconds"
                },
                "min": 0,
                "show": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource"
                    },
                    "query": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (model, le) (label_replace(rate(llm_d_epp_scheduler_e2e_duration_seconds_bucket[$rate_interval]), \"model\", \"$1\", \"job\", \"(vllm-.*)-epp\")))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{model}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "scheduler_e2e_p99": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
